%% Lab 12: retrieve, then generate. Once: every document is embedded and stored with its name. For every question:
%% embed it the same way, search the store for the nearest k documents, pack them with their names, and let the chat
%% model answer only from them or say it does not know. Ink: model calls. Lime: our code and the store's search.
%% Export: npx -y @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli -i lab12_retrieve_then_generate.mmd -o lab12_retrieve_then_generate.png -b white -s 2
flowchart TB
    subgraph once [once]
        docs[the documents] --> embedD[embed each document<br/>1,536 numbers each]
        embedD --> store[(vector store<br/>name, text, vector)]
    end
    subgraph every [for every question]
        question[the question] --> embedQ[embed the question]
        embedQ --> search[search<br/>the nearest k documents]
        search --> pack[pack<br/>each name and text]
        pack --> generate[generate<br/>answer only from these]
        generate -->|they answer it| answer[the answer]
        generate -->|they do not| refuse[I don't know]
    end
    store --> search
    classDef model fill:#0B1220,color:#FFFFFF,stroke:#0B1220
    classDef code fill:#C9F24D,color:#0B1220,stroke:#0B1220
    class embedD,embedQ,generate model
    class search,pack code
